for a non-Impact frame, proper fit cannot be guaranteed. Fit is guaranteed only when used with the corresponding Impact Canopy product line.&nbsp;<br><br><b>Another important note regarding color matching:</b>&nbsp; Due to dye lots, ink formulas, and color profiles, the only way to ensure the most consistent colors across all of your products is to order all products at the same time.&nbsp; While we will always do our very best, we cannot guarantee an EXACT color match for products ordered at different times.<br><br><strong>Items arrived damage:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>If you received items damaged during transit, you must report the damage to us within 72 hours of receiving your order.&nbsp; Seven (7) photos of the damaged products and cartons are required.&nbsp; Inspection of the packages and contents may be needed for damage claims.&nbsp; If these requirements are not made, we will not be able to honor the reshipment, replacement or reimbursement of the items.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">If deemed necessary that the product must be shipped back to Impact Canopies for inspection, it is the customer’s responsibility to pay for shipping.</span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-6efc" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-lmUbDS kbVXZM pf-33_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-cTTcKX dkCVVW"><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-34_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ezrfit gUxRQT pf-35_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bOQUxc cBnkcD pf-36_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-38_">WARRANTY:</span></h2><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fscnvs ckThdY pf-39_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-40_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-42_">1 year limited warranty from the date of purchase for stock, unprinted fabric items including tops, walls, rail skirts, table covers, and rain gutters.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-43_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-45_">6 months limited warranty from the date of purchase for custom printed fabric items - unless otherwise specified - due to fade or a manufacturing defect. IMPORTANT NOTE: Once the artwork is approved, Impact Canopy is not responsible for any issues pertaining to the design.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-46_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-48_">1 year limited warranty from the date of purchase for frames of TL, ALDS, Carnival kits</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-49_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-51_">5 year limited warranty from the date of purchase for frames of CL*, DS*.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-52_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-54_">10&nbsp; year limited warranty from the date of purchase for frames of Mega*, ML*, M*</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-55_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-57_">5&nbsp; year limited warranty from the date of purchase for frames of Display Dome, Expodome</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-58_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-60_">3 months limited warranty from date of original purchase for Rail Skirt hardware and all sizes of Canopy Roller Bags</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-61_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-63_">3 years limited warranty from the date of purchase for Rubber Weights&nbsp;</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-64_ pf-text-1